{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:48 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:48 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:48 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"「綫路英雄」潘頓今日七捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e17615f310b41172e9b0484bbcee14e7/2026-11/r11_1.jpg\"/><p>今日潘頓殺得性起，在第十場夥拍一點七倍大熱門「嵐臣」贏得今日第六場頭馬，接着在尾場三班千四米，再策騎「綫路英雄」贏得今日第七場頭馬，亦提早就封王成為騎師王冠軍。今季沈集成馬房和潘頓，至今合作贏得七場頭馬。</p><p>此外，廖康銘則以四十八分，成為練馬師王冠軍。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:03:44.626445+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:48:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:30.937914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:24.964267+00:00","content_hash":"44bb140b5377dd0f5789ab9a4a0e7fd7308b10d64c6865ccd0ebac4a86a42684","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}